-- ACTOR ------------------- errors/codec_missing_2.march

`Node.enqueue` needs a JSON codec for `Ping`, and none is derived. [codec_missing]
A remote message crosses the network as JSON, and its type's name is its wire tag; a receiver decodes it with `from_json`.

16 |     let _ = Node.enqueue(q, GlobalPid.make("b", 1, 1), p, NodeQueue.DropNew)
                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

    Add `derive Json for Ping` next to its declaration.
    run `march --explain codec_missing`


